      "content": "thanks. it's getting better, but i'm still worried about that \"40%\" figure. even if we call it a success, seeing a number less than half will make the board nervous.\n\nlook, I need this to be bulletproof for the gala. if we aren't explicit about the 40%, we can just speak in terms of the \"thousands of families\" or \"vast regions of East Africa\" that have been transformed. can you do a final version where we drop the specific percentages entirely and just focus on the massive, transformative scale of the achievement? make it sound like the foundation is fully built and we are just looking for the final push to complete the entire region.",
